    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/98319260dfe2f0ebb9de6921bee108bb.avif?t=1752429112\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span>When the world is engulfed in flame and hope turns to ash, every moment shapes destiny. Step into the epic fantasy &quot;<strong>Ash and Flame&quot;</strong> \u2014 a cinematic adventure where your choices change everything.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/c5805212d1616213a145cdd5503b2c0b.avif?t=1752429112\" width=610 height=360 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Raynar Talvord</strong>, a war veteran longing to forget a bloodstained past. But ancient evil has awakened, threatening to destroy everything you hold dear. Unite humans, elves, and dwarves \u2014 or doom the world to eternal darkness under the Flame of Ash and its ominous leader, the Black Rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>25 Prologue Outcomes</strong> \u2013 Your early choices instantly affect the lives of 11 characters and the entire story.<br>\u2022 <strong>Non-linear &amp; Emotional</strong> \u2013 Face harsh moral dilemmas that test your beliefs and convictions.<br>\u2022 <strong>A Living, Brutal World</strong> \u2013 Explore stunning locations, from burning villages to ancient fortresses.<br>\u2022 <strong>Vivid Characters</strong> \u2013 Discover the pain of assassin Kaira, the hope of young Brenn, and the unshakable will of Lord Edric.<br>\u2022 <strong>Cinematic Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Powered by Unreal Engine 5.4, with filmic presentation and a powerful mix of orchestral and rapcore music.<br>\u2022 <strong>Epic Battles</strong> \u2013 Feel the intensity of large-scale fights where every move reshapes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/22437fc526882af7a46a0b70af04027d.poster.webp?t=1752429112\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/22437fc526882af7a46a0b70af04027d.webp?t=1752429112\" class=\"bb_img\" width=633 height=356 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your time has come. Take up your sword and step into the flame \u2014 the fate of the world is now in your hands!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/98319260dfe2f0ebb9de6921bee108bb.avif?t=1752429112\" data-has-big width=800 height=234 /></span>When the world is engulfed in flame and hope turns to ash, every moment shapes destiny. Step into the epic fantasy &quot;<strong>Ash and Flame&quot;</strong> \u2014 a cinematic adventure where your choices change everything.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/c5805212d1616213a145cdd5503b2c0b.avif?t=1752429112\" width=610 height=360 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Raynar Talvord</strong>, a war veteran longing to forget a bloodstained past. But ancient evil has awakened, threatening to destroy everything you hold dear. Unite humans, elves, and dwarves \u2014 or doom the world to eternal darkness under the Flame of Ash and its ominous leader, the Black Rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>25 Prologue Outcomes</strong> \u2013 Your early choices instantly affect the lives of 11 characters and the entire story.<br>\u2022 <strong>Non-linear &amp; Emotional</strong> \u2013 Face harsh moral dilemmas that test your beliefs and convictions.<br>\u2022 <strong>A Living, Brutal World</strong> \u2013 Explore stunning locations, from burning villages to ancient fortresses.<br>\u2022 <strong>Vivid Characters</strong> \u2013 Discover the pain of assassin Kaira, the hope of young Brenn, and the unshakable will of Lord Edric.<br>\u2022 <strong>Cinematic Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Powered by Unreal Engine 5.4, with filmic presentation and a powerful mix of orchestral and rapcore music.<br>\u2022 <strong>Epic Battles</strong> \u2013 Feel the intensity of large-scale fights where every move reshapes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/22437fc526882af7a46a0b70af04027d.poster.webp?t=1752429112\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761130/extras/22437fc526882af7a46a0b70af04027d.webp?t=1752429112\" class=\"bb_img\" width=633 height=356 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your time has come. Take up your sword and step into the flame \u2014 the fate of the world is now in your hands!</h2>",
    "short_description": "Ash and Flame is an interactive cinematic thriller set in the dark fantasy world of Erwintal. You are Raynar, a war veteran who takes up his sword once more to face an ancient evil. Your choices shape the kingdom\u2019s fate: ashes\u2026 or the flame of hope.",
